# The same board, which builds its charts itself: its initializer keeps a chart it makes in each of its fields
# (`self.left = Chart("left")`). A value kept in a field is the body's own code putting it there, a lens's put: the board
# the initializer builds holds the chart, so the initializer's own arrow takes it (#176), as building the clean board
# takes the charts it is handed. The figures are the clean side's: each rests in the part of the board that holds it.

